3. Everything else
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
All other source in this repository is original to this project.
`external_repos/ocean_t/`, `external_repos/SVIn/`,
`external_repos/sonar_camera_reconstruction/`, `external_repos/holoocean-ros/`,
and `external_repos/holoocean_bridge/` remain unmodified, independently
licensed reference repositories consulted for reference/porting; they are not
part of this repository's build or version history (see .gitignore).

`include/adapters/holoocean_ros_bridge_sonar_frame_provider.hpp`'s
field-mapping (which fields of `holoocean_interfaces/msg/ImagingSonar` to
use, and the mirror-flip correction) was worked out by reading
`external_repos/holoocean_bridge/holoocean_bridge/sonar_adapter_node.py` (a
separate, not-vendored ROS2 package targeting `sonar_oculus/OculusPing`,
MIT-compatible per its own package.xml) — this is a "read for reference" case
like the rest of this section, not a code port: the implementation here is
original, targets a different message type (`uw::domain::SonarFrame`), and is
written in C++ against this platform's own conventions. See
`adapters/holoocean_ros_bridge.md` for the specifics of what was learned from
the reference and why.
